  "title": "Where to ski"
 },
 "description": "Rank resorts by live conditions, optionally shaped by who is going.\n    Lenses: powder3d (3-day snow), snow7d, base (deepest base), bluebird\n    (sunny days after snow), freeze (freeze margin), highcold (coldest high).\n    Optional country ISO-2, min_summit metres, glacier-only, min_lifts.\n\n    preset accepts a comma list of people-shaped filters, each a bundle of\n    published thresholds rather than a mood: kids (2+ magic carpets, 40%+ easy\n    terrain), beginners, adventurous (15+ km of hard piste, 1000 m vertical),\n    cosy (at most 12 lifts), big (100+ km), snowsure, reach (within 90 min of\n    an airport), budget (day pass under EUR 52). Every ranked row comes back\n    with a `why` list naming the thresholds it actually met. Top 20 max.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "properties": {
   "country": {
    "default": "",
    "title": "Country",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "glacier": {
    "default": false,
    "title": "Glacier",
    "type": "boolean"
   },
   "lens": {
    "default": "powder3d",
    "title": "Lens",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "limit": {
    "default": 10,
    "title": "Limit",
    "type": "integer"
   },
   "min_lifts": {
    "default": 0,
    "title": "Min Lifts",
    "type": "integer"
   },
   "min_summit": {
    "default": 0,
    "title": "Min Summit",
    "type": "integer"
   },
   "preset": {
    "default": "",
    "title": "Preset",
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "title": "where_to_skiArguments",
  "type": "object"
 },
